Subject: [PATCH 03/30] KITKAT-P8: Restore 4.4 UI sounds and default wallpaper

- 13 ui-sound sources from android-4.4.4_r1 replaced in the files
  AllAudio.mk / aosp_audio.mk install to /media/audio/ui/ (Effect_Tick,
  Lock, Unlock, five Keypress sounds, Dock, Undock, LowBattery,
  VideoRecord, camera_click) plus their plain-name copies
- 4.4 default wallpaper converted to PNG for all three density buckets
